      "hash64": "02AC435163FB721D",
      "text": "[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳就是帕底亞地區的……\\n那個什麼學院的學生？[VAR 0x0114(002C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
